{"id":"n62079-6-12","stage":2,"title":"빛 · 风光","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62079-6-12-1","ko":"우리가 너를 도와줄게.","zh":"我们会帮你解决这个问题的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리가","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너를","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도와줄게.","meaning":"帮，帮助；表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","explanation":"돕다：帮，帮助；주다：表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"돕다","audio":"/audio/7feaaecf170e0c6a578f.mp3"},{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17203","senseId":"1","lemma":"돕다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"7feaaecf170e0c6a","term":"돕다","zh":"帮，帮助","audio":"/audio/7feaaecf170e0c6a578f.mp3","entryId":"17203","definition":"给别人正在做的事打下手或添帮手。","pronunciation":["돕ː따"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f404295f1fd3bed5cbaf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62079-6-12-2","ko":"아, 어떻게 일을 끝내나 했는데 이제야 빛이 보이네.","zh":"啊，我还担心要怎么才能完成工作呢，现在总算看到希望了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아,","meaning":"咳","explanation":"아：咳","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"3","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일을","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끝내나","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"끝내다：结束，完成；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"끝내다","audio":"/audio/686f8e089bf22cd01d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29692","senseId":"1","lemma":"끝내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했는데","meaning":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","explanation":"하다：表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"32","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이제야","meaning":"这才","explanation":"이제야：这才","readings":[{"term":"이제야","audio":"/audio/2be18ec567b0073f4c4c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24993","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제야","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빛이","meaning":"风光，意义，曙光","explanation":"빛：风光，意义，曙光；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"빛","audio":"/audio/bcfe8128a79515eee12a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62079","senseId":"6","lemma":"빛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보이네.","meaning":"可见，看得到","explanation":"보이다：可见，看得到；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"3","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d6ce479be9ddc9b7","term":"아","zh":"咳","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3","entryId":"16247","definition":"感到烦恼、担心、惋惜、叹息时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"686f8e089bf22cd0","term":"끝내다","zh":"结束，完成","audio":"/audio/686f8e089bf22cd01d10.mp3","entryId":"29692","definition":"做完事情。","pronunciation":["끈내다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"2be18ec567b0073f","term":"이제야","zh":"这才","audio":"/audio/2be18ec567b0073f4c4c.mp3","entryId":"24993","definition":"说话的当时才。","pronunciation":["이제야"]},{"id":"bcfe8128a79515ee","term":"빛","zh":"风光，意义，曙光","audio":"/audio/bcfe8128a79515eee12a.mp3","entryId":"62079","definition":"(喻义)希望或荣誉。","pronunciation":["빋"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"可见，看得到","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"某种结果出来。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/189882f622e030a445ec.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.677,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62079","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"6","sourceLevel":"중급","day":81,"sequenceScore":2.2291,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["啊，我还担心要怎么才能完成工作呢，现在总算看到希望了。","我们会帮你解决这个问题的。","我觉得今天的戏剧剧情有点难懂。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我们会帮你解决这个问题的。","我觉得今天的戏剧剧情有点难懂。","啊，我还担心要怎么才能完成工作呢，现在总算看到希望了。"],"answer":2}]}
